    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>This is a very short game~</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the abandoned wetlands, use  silk to swing and hang deftly, navigating through the decayed environment. Facing hostile creatures lurking within the microecosystem, you'll need precise shooting and quick reflexes to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, and swing\u2014this is a survival adventure set in a microcosmic world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Game feature</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to this overlooked wetland, where peculiar ecosystems and unique landscapes thrive. But beware \u2013 this realm has its own rules!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/5b6c694ca044edd857b2e74731e865cc.poster.avif?t=1748338205\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/5b6c694ca044edd857b2e74731e865cc.webm?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/5b6c694ca044edd857b2e74731e865cc.mp4?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>jump, grapple, swing, glide... Your movement is full of possibilities. Attack your enemies in unexpected ways. But don't fall into the water \u2013 there might be other dangers lurking... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/19b09d32d35c06acb653c3ab07127ca6.poster.avif?t=1748338205\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/19b09d32d35c06acb653c3ab07127ca6.webm?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/19b09d32d35c06acb653c3ab07127ca6.mp4?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your arsenal to combat escalating threats! Keep an eye out for those aspergillus flavus \u2013 destroying them will charge your weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/1356ca569ca73b0214325a71fc94bf03.poster.avif?t=1748338205\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/1356ca569ca73b0214325a71fc94bf03.webm?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/1356ca569ca73b0214325a71fc94bf03.mp4?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>This is a very short game~</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the abandoned wetlands, use  silk to swing and hang deftly, navigating through the decayed environment. Facing hostile creatures lurking within the microecosystem, you'll need precise shooting and quick reflexes to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, and swing\u2014this is a survival adventure set in a microcosmic world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Game feature</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to this overlooked wetland, where peculiar ecosystems and unique landscapes thrive. But beware \u2013 this realm has its own rules!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/5b6c694ca044edd857b2e74731e865cc.poster.avif?t=1748338205\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/5b6c694ca044edd857b2e74731e865cc.webm?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/5b6c694ca044edd857b2e74731e865cc.mp4?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>jump, grapple, swing, glide... Your movement is full of possibilities. Attack your enemies in unexpected ways. But don't fall into the water \u2013 there might be other dangers lurking... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/19b09d32d35c06acb653c3ab07127ca6.poster.avif?t=1748338205\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/19b09d32d35c06acb653c3ab07127ca6.webm?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/19b09d32d35c06acb653c3ab07127ca6.mp4?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your arsenal to combat escalating threats! Keep an eye out for those aspergillus flavus \u2013 destroying them will charge your weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/1356ca569ca73b0214325a71fc94bf03.poster.avif?t=1748338205\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/1356ca569ca73b0214325a71fc94bf03.webm?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361000/extras/1356ca569ca73b0214325a71fc94bf03.mp4?t=1748338205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
